            "title": "3. We draft it with you",
            "text": "<p>After a 50% deposit to lock a production slot, we iterate. You get a draft by email, mark changes, we incorporate your changes and send the next one. Nothing is cut until you give the green light. Most pieces take three drafts. Allow about two weeks for this stage, four days a draft. Tight date? Say so on the form below - for a fee we can expedite your map from about 24 days to 10.</p>",
