    "section_rich_text_8XPHJ7": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "name": "Rich text",
      "settings": {
        "subheading": "",
        "title": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>If the country is gentle</strong><br/><br/>After crafting 800+ maps, I've honed my judgement on setting a contour interval that creates a 3D form that isn't too flat, or too vertically exaggerated and full of cliffs. Fence lines, the house, dams and waterways carry a lot of the picture on gentler ground. We also have a range of design techniques such as engraved hill shades and vegetation hatching that can be incorporated as suitable.</p><p><strong>Not happy with the map?</strong><br/><br/>30 days after it arrives: if you or the recipient does not love it, send it back for a full refund. In the unlikely case it's damaged in transit, we'll replace it. The piece is built to last, that's why we have a 5-year warranty.</p><p><strong>What it costs</strong><br/><br/>Full price for custom farm maps start from USD $750, the medium is $1150, the large is $1690. 50% deposit holds the timber and production slot; then 50% when you approve the design. The preview is free so you are not buying blind.</p><p><strong>What to do now</strong><br/><br/>Use the form at the bottom of this page to request your digital preview. Each month we have a limited number of slots and only take on jobs that we are confident will result in a piece that looks great.</p>",
        "text_size": 2,
        "text_columns": 1,
        "align_text": "text-left",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_url": "",
        "button_color": "btn--neutral",
        "button_style": "caps--large",
        "height": "margin--medium",
        "width": "wrapper",
        "text_color": "text-dark",
        "bg_color": "#ffffff"
      }
    },
    "page_faq_TzNHny": {
      "type": "page-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_MGEmHe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I only have the address. Is that enough?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. We source boundaries, terrain and roads. A screenshot or title plan helps and speeds the first preview. It is not required.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_iVbX7F": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between the free preview and the real drafts?",
            "content": "<p>The preview is a first look at the land so you can decide. The paid drafts are the design we will cut - contours, labels, legend, boundaries, waterways. Most designs are approved by the third draft.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6P4RXY": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does the whole thing take?",
            "content": "<p>Preview: within 48 hours. Then about two weeks of drafting, one week to make the physical piece, 2-4 business days for DHL to the US and AU. Standard total is about three weeks after you go ahead. Need it sooner? Ask for expedited - for a fee we can compress that to 10 days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_9cwXEz": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When do I pay?",
            "content": "<p>Nothing for the preview. 50% to start the proper drafts and hold a production slot. The remaining 50% when you approve the design, before we cut wood.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_f9WcJE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "There are so many styles. How do I choose?",
            "content": "<p>You do not have to. After the preview we will show a short set of techniques and you mark what you like. We recommend what will look best on that land.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_LRgTKL": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do you cover shipping, tariffs and duty?",
            "content": "<p>DHL Express is included. We cover import duty and tariffs on the orders we ship, so the tracking emails are just tracking - not a bill at the door.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3jQj6U": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I add tracks, dams, or place names later?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, during drafting. We will not cut until those are right.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_PdkqMj": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is this a good gift if they already have photos of the farm?",
            "content": "<p>Photos show a moment. This shows the real 3D form of the land - the ridge behind the sheds, the front dam, the old boundary. That is why it stays on the wall and why it works for people who are hard to buy for.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
